                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - At the conclusion of debate on H.R. 3628, the Chair put the question on passage of the bill and by voice vote announced the ayes had prevailed. Mr. Pallone demanded the yeas and nays and the Chair postponed further proceedings until a time to be announced.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "18:34:04",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 936, the House proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Moore (WV) amendment No. 1",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "17:56:53",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H.R. 3628.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "17:56:30",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 3898, H.R. 3383, H.R. 3638, H.R. 3628, H.R. 3668 and S. 1071. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 3898, H.R. 3383, H.R. 3638, and H.R. 3628 under a structured rule; and H.R. 3668 and S. 1071 under a closed rule. The resolution provides for one motion to recommit on H.R. 3898, H.R. 3383, H.R. 3638, H.R. 3628, and H.R. 3668; and one motion to commit on S. 1071.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H30000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-10",
            "actionTime": "17:56:25",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 936. (consideration: CR H5522-5528; text: CR H5522-5523)",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H1L210",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-09",
            "actionTime": "19:52:18",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 936 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 3898, H.R. 3383, H.R. 3638, H.R. 3628, H.R. 3668 and S. 1071. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 3898, H.R. 3383, H.R. 3638, and H.R. 3628 under a structured rule; and H.R. 3668 and S. 1071 under a closed rule. The resolution provides for one motion to recommit on H.R. 3898, H.R. 3383, H.R. 3638, H.R. 3628, and H.R. 3668; and one motion to commit on S. 1071.",
            "type": "Floor"
